WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.400
Follow the energy step by step, and don't forget the by-products.

2
00:00:05.028 --> 00:00:08.578
A real coaster has friction and air resistance.

3
00:00:10.448 --> 00:00:15.248
Potential becomes kinetic, and some becomes heat and sound on the way.

4
00:00:16.023 --> 00:00:20.773
That's why later hills are lower: some energy has gone to the surroundings.
